selected Auto Run recipe.

Only the solvents used in the current recipe are
evalueted.

A warning is shown when the solvent level is
between 30% and 50%.

An interlock is triggerd when the solvent level is
below 30%." data-tchmi-top="170" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="214" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="false" data-tchmi-ignore-escape-sequences="false" data-tchmi-text-font-family="" data-tchmi-text-font-size="11" data-tchmi-zindex="3">

