empty, and ready to receive the sample. " data-tchmi-top="460" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="214" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="false" data-tchmi-ignore-escape-sequences="false" data-tchmi-text-font-size="11" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
