<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1061" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="75" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="234" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Check if Vials Rack is
not in place" data-tchmi-top="792" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="284" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="true" data-tchmi-text-font-size="28" data-tchmi-text-font-weight="Bold" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmi_Controls_Beckhoff_TcHmiImage_243" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiImage" data-tchmi-height="20" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="220" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-src="Resources/Custom/Images/Reminders/infoIcon.svg" data-tchmi-top="874" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="20" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1062" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="119" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="248" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Checks that the vial rack is removed from it's operating
position before calibration.

The vials rack must not be in place during this process,
otherwise it may physically restrict motor movement. 

If the system detects the vials rack in place, an interlock is
triggered and calibration cannot proceed. " data-tchmi-top="874" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="272" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="false" data-tchmi-ignore-escape-sequences="false" data-tchmi-text-font-size="11" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-background-color" type="application/json">
{
  "color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7058823)"
}
</script>
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1063" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="75" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="759" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Check if Calibration box is
filled and in place" data-tchmi-top="771" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="295" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="true" data-tchmi-text-font-size="28" data-tchmi-text-font-weight="Bold" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmi_Controls_Beckhoff_TcHmiImage_245" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiImage" data-tchmi-height="20" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="773" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-src="Resources/Custom/Images/Reminders/infoIcon.svg" data-tchmi-top="853" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="20" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1064" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="152" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="800" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Verifies that the calibration box is correctly positioned
on the scale and contains the required amount of liquid.

If the box is not placed in position up to the optical
sensor limit, an interlock is triggered.

The box weight must be between 1100g and 1200g.

If the weight is outside this range, calibration stops with
a scale attention warning until corrected. " data-tchmi-top="853" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="254" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="false" data-tchmi-ignore-escape-sequences="false" data-tchmi-text-font-size="11" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-background-color" type="application/json">
{
  "color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7058823)"
}
</script>
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1065" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="75" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="573" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Check if Scale is ready
to use" data-tchmi-top="1023" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="295" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="true" data-tchmi-text-font-size="28" data-tchmi-text-font-weight="Bold" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmi_Controls_Beckhoff_TcHmiImage_247" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiImage" data-tchmi-height="20" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="546" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-src="Resources/Custom/Images/Reminders/infoIcon.svg" data-tchmi-top="1104" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="20" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1066" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="122" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="573" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Checks that the scale is ready for calibration.

The scale must be free of errors, automatic
adjustment must be disable, and the weight
reading must be stable. 

If any of these conditions is no met, calibration
cannot proceed until the issue is corrected. " data-tchmi-top="1104" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="248" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="false" data-tchmi-ignore-escape-sequences="false" data-tchmi-text-font-size="11" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-background-color" type="application/json">
{
  "color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7058823)"
}
</script>
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1067" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="75" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="220" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Check if Stage Collection
Motor is in Home Postion" data-tchmi-top="1023" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="295" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="true" data-tchmi-text-font-size="28" data-tchmi-text-font-weight="Bold" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmi_Controls_Beckhoff_TcHmiImage_249" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiImage" data-tchmi-height="20" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="230" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-src="Resources/Custom/Images/Reminders/infoIcon.svg" data-tchmi-top="1142" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="20" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_1068" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="84" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="256" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="Checks that the Stage Collection motor is at the
Home position before calibration. 

If the motor is not in the Home position, an interlock
is triggered and calibration cannot proceed. " data-tchmi-top="1142" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="259" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="false" data-tchmi-ignore-escape-sequences="false" data-tchmi-text-font-size="11" data-tchmi-zindex="3">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-background-color" type="application/json">
{
